        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "bebeec83-b290-5e03-b23e-b1d0987d66b3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christoph Martin Wieland, Carl Maria von Weber, Maxine Peake, Matt Lucas, John Hannah, Nonso Anozie\n- Works: Geschichte des Agathon, Oberon, A Midsummer Night's Dream (2016 film), Oberon (opera)\n- Characters: Oberon, Titania, Bottom, Theseus\n- Concepts: Bildungsroman\n- Topics: medieval literature, Renaissance literature\n\nFacts:\n- Christoph Martin Wieland is best remembered for writing Geschichte des Agathon, described as the first Bildungsroman.\n- Christoph Martin Wieland also wrote the epic Oberon.\n- Carl Maria von Weber's opera Oberon was based on Christoph Martin Wieland's epic Oberon.\n- In medieval and Renaissance literature, Oberon is a king of the fairies.\n- The 2016 film A Midsummer Night's Dream stars Maxine Peake as Titania, Matt Lucas as Bottom, John Hannah as Theseus, and Nonso Anozie as Oberon.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
